{"category": "LOAN", "intent": "cancel_loan", "response": "We're accountable for, and we apologize for any inconvenience caused by your request to cancel a loan. As a customer service representative, I'm here to assist you. However, I would need some additional information to proceed with the cancellation process. Please provide me with the following details:

1. Loan account number or reference: {{Loan Account Number}}
2. Your full name as it appears on the loan account: {{Full Name}}
3. Contact information (email address or phone number): {{Contact Information}}

Once I have these details, I will be able to guide you through the necessary steps to cancel your loan."}

{"category": "ACCOUNT", "intent": "close_account", "response": "I sincerely apologize for any frustration or inconvenience you've experienced with your account. I understand that you no longer wish to use it. 

To help you with this, I kindly request you to provide me with the necessary details such as your {{Account Username}} or {{Email Address}} associated with the account. With this information, I will guide you through the process of deactivating or closing your account. 

Rest assured, I am here to assist you every step of the way. Feel free to ask any questions or concerns you may have during the process."}

{"category": "CONTACT", "intent": "human_agent", "response": "I genuinely apologize for any frustration or inconvenience you may have experienced. I understand that sometimes it's necessary to connect with a human agent for assistance. I'm here to help you with that. 

To speak to a human agent, you can reach out to our dedicated customer support team. They are available {{Customer Support Working Hours}}. You can contact them through our {{Customer Support Phone Number}} or by sending an email to {{Customer Support Email}}. They will be more than happy to assist you with any concerns you have.

Please let me know if there's anything else I can assist you with."}

{"category": "LOAN", "intent": "apply_for_loan", "response": "Thank you for expressing your interest in applying for a loan. We are here to guide you through the process. To start your loan application, you can visit our website at {{Company Website URL}}. On the homepage, you will find a section dedicated to loans or financing options. Click on that section to explore the loan products we offer.

Alternatively, if you prefer a more personalized experience or have specific questions, our customer service team is available to assist you. You can reach out to them through our live chat feature on the website or by calling {{Customer Support Phone Number}} during our business hours, which are {{Customer Support Working Hours}}.

Applying for a loan is a simple process, and we will provide you with all the necessary information and guidance along the way. If you have any other questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out. We look forward to helping you with your loan application!"}
